[7.691, "o", "miu-cr: 04:43:32.953 done: 1 findings\r\n\u001b[31m\u001b[1m✖ CRITICAL (security)\u001b[0m  \u001b[36mapi/admin.go:7-10\u001b[0m\r\n    Without the return, every non-admin request falls through and the handler appends the full secretReport() body after the 403 forbidden message. Any client that reads the response body gets the secret report regardless of status code, an authorization bypass. Restore the early return.\r\n  \u001b[2mcode:\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m│ if !isAdmin(r) {\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m│ \t\thttp.Error(w, \"forbidden\", http.StatusForbidden)\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m│ \t}\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m│ \tw.Write([]byte(secretReport()))\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  \u001b[2msuggested patch:\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m│ \tif !isAdmin(r) {\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m│ \t\thttp.Error(w, \"forbidden\", http.StatusForbidden)\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m│ \t\treturn\u001b[0m\r\n    \u001b[2m│ \t}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    \u001b[2m│ \tw.Write([]byte(secretReport()))\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n1 finding(s):\r\n  critical 1\r\n"]
[0.002, "o", "exit=2\r\n"]
